{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "03AO", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{equation-cech-functor}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{homology-lemma-exact-functor}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-cech-exact-presheaves}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5f87957dd0da910d0676da0e6cee8f196b730b27884802a2b99a42c1d7847bf6", "source_text": "The functor given by Equation (<REF_0001>)\nis an exact functor (see Homology, Lemma <REF_0002>).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3f47bf449ad2f975be0ccd6de25e17f4300f280a950a42cdb2ffd90b214f8818", "unit_id": "tag:03AQ:statement"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "03AO", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$W$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{F} \\mapsto \\mathcal{F}(W)$", "MATH_0004": "$\\textit{PAb}(\\mathcal{C})$", "MATH_0005": "$\\textit{Ab}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\check{\\mathcal{C}}^p(\\mathcal{U}, \\mathcal{F})$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:6e943a9cee8389d3f51c4a7c42ffd339fe2b17c9eecfc6ea25a98b1033ffda8b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:dab7f8e7a4783f45e2d01017c93eb1b2ff017619514e14b2955d0238e637172c", "source_text": "For any object <MATH_0001> of <MATH_0002> the functor\n<MATH_0003> is an additive exact functor\nfrom <MATH_0004> to <MATH_0005>.\nThe terms <MATH_0006>\nof the complex are products of these exact functors and hence exact.\nMoreover a sequence of complexes is exact if and only if the sequence\nof terms in a given degree is exact. Hence the lemma follows.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:346b567ca8f8b1d15d6532372cb3b08208901f026f06cc9d1b90b10b822bd1e0", "unit_id": "tag:03AQ:proof"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "03AO", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{U} = \\{U_i \\to U\\}_{i \\in I}$", "MATH_0003": "$U_{i_0} \\times_U \\ldots \\times_U U_{i_p}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{F} \\mapsto \\check{H}^n(\\mathcal{U}, \\mathcal{F})$", "MATH_0006": "$\\delta$", "MATH_0007": "$\\textit{PAb}(\\mathcal{C})$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathbf{Z}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{homology-definition-cohomological-delta-functor}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-cech-cohomology-delta-functor-presheaves}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:aadbc58e338742fe76c40ce7c6cc7a84d9f96067cc746e1f1e49d865c15f2e89", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5e942e937be55d14e6b7766aef63c9c6d03f1338dbe368e23145e629834e8868", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a family of morphisms\nwith fixed target such that all fibre products\n<MATH_0003> exist in <MATH_0004>.\nThe functors <MATH_0005>\nform a <MATH_0006>-functor from the abelian category <MATH_0007>\nto the category of <MATH_0008>-modules (see\nHomology, Definition <REF_0001>).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1bc712b981e2db15ef8beffcd5dfa3f94d095d2c6793181773bbb7cf8ff5a7aa", "unit_id": "tag:03AR:statement"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "03AO", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$0 \\to \\mathcal{F}_1 \\to \\mathcal{F}_2 \\to \\mathcal{F}_3 \\to 0$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathbf{Z}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\delta_{\\mathcal{F}_1 \\to \\mathcal{F}_2 \\to \\mathcal{F}_3} :\n\\check{H}^n(\\mathcal{U}, \\mathcal{F}_3) \\to\n\\check{H}^{n + 1}(\\mathcal{U}, \\mathcal{F}_1)$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-cech-exact-presheaves}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{homology-lemma-long-exact-sequence-cochain}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:12c25df16d762f33b74ab7bcdd01625a51a14f3c3b41bd9b7a6e9e3d33b827a5", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8b3eaee0afeb44b729d1480d05f3e28a21d8b4a6ae7d1e0700fedd725209e8ad", "source_text": "By\nLemma <REF_0001>\na short exact sequence of abelian presheaves\n<MATH_0001>\nis turned into a short exact sequence of complexes of\n<MATH_0002>-modules. Hence we can use\nHomology, Lemma <REF_0002>\nto get the boundary maps\n<MATH_0003>\nand a corresponding long exact sequence. We omit the verification\nthat these maps are compatible with maps between short exact\nsequences of presheaves.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:eea8744874449ac414b1383782bc9fe9d11846dcfc5c4878a0c93de0ac54de49", "unit_id": "tag:03AR:proof"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "03AO", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{U} = \\{U_i \\to U\\}_{i \\in I}$", "MATH_0003": "$U_{i_0} \\times_U \\ldots \\times_U U_{i_p}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathbf{Z}_{\\mathcal{U}, \\bullet}$", "MATH_0006": "$$\n\\ldots\n\\to\n\\bigoplus_{i_0i_1i_2} \\mathbf{Z}_{U_{i_0} \\times_U U_{i_1} \\times_U U_{i_2}}\n\\to\n\\bigoplus_{i_0i_1} \\mathbf{Z}_{U_{i_0} \\times_U U_{i_1}}\n\\to\n\\bigoplus_{i_0} \\mathbf{Z}_{U_{i_0}}\n\\to 0 \\to \\ldots\n$$", "MATH_0007": "$0$", "MATH_0008": "$$\n\\mathbf{Z}_{U_{i_0} \\times_U \\ldots \\times_u U_{i_{p + 1}}}\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathbf{Z}_{U_{i_0} \\times_U\n\\ldots \\widehat{U_{i_j}} \\ldots \\times_U U_{i_{p + 1}}}\n$$", "MATH_0009": "$(-1)^j$", "MATH_0010": "$$\n\\Hom_{\\textit{PAb}(\\mathcal{C})}(\\mathbf{Z}_{\\mathcal{U}, \\bullet}, \\mathcal{F})\n=\n\\check{\\mathcal{C}}^\\bullet(\\mathcal{U}, \\mathcal{F})\n$$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{F} \\in \\Ob(\\textit{PAb}(\\mathcal{C}))$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-cech-map-into}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44e15d166d5ce1073aafc97e164c53021a23c4abe4dec687c9e703f47e04d5b6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5027a2b1151c6f38649e3b6f67a9ed31e57c12cd5b0fb1b26dec0e985e3f1ce2", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category. Let <MATH_0002>\nbe a family of morphisms with fixed target such that all fibre products\n<MATH_0003> exist in <MATH_0004>.\nConsider the chain complex <MATH_0005>\nof abelian presheaves\n<MATH_0006>\nwhere the last nonzero term is placed in degree <MATH_0007>\nand where the map\n<MATH_0008>\nis given by <MATH_0009> times the canonical map.\nThen there is an isomorphism\n<MATH_0010>\nfunctorial in <MATH_0011>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9b9f9872b5769e4ada1c07213d1727a3bc545f0da78d6fde2864992b2f1bf3fa", "unit_id": "tag:03AS:statement"}
{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "03AO", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "\\begin{align*}\n\\Hom_{\\textit{PAb}(\\mathcal{C})}(\n\\bigoplus_{i_0 \\ldots i_p}\n\\mathbf{Z}_{U_{i_0} \\times_U \\ldots \\times_U U_{i_p}},\n\\mathcal{F})\n& =\n\\prod_{i_0 \\ldots i_p}\n\\Hom_{\\textit{PAb}(\\mathcal{C})}(\n\\mathbf{Z}_{U_{i_0} \\times_U \\ldots \\times_U U_{i_p}},\n\\mathcal{F}) \\\\\n& =\n\\prod_{i_0 \\ldots i_p}\n\\mathcal{F}(U_{i_0} \\times_U \\ldots \\times_U U_{i_p})\n\\end{align*}", "REF_0001": "\\ref{sites-modules-lemma-obvious-adjointness}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c2146df96861a8c773156fbf767a8b5f94c928abcb522a3085c89675ba39a1c6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4efcd96c888f7c2909b16d247ca8b5b8fbaaa2b690610cee0fd3c5dc9e8c873f", "source_text": "This is a tautology based on the fact that\n<MATH_0001>\nsee Modules on Sites, Lemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f97ef989eea7a112bcee4c3d272b629cd7b23285c861c13e5dd42362086bbdc2", "unit_id": "tag:03AS:proof"}
